Share of signatures (random sets) or permutations (fixed signatures) with p < 0.05;
p for the fixed signatures on the observed labels. Under permuted labels the expected share is 0.05.
cox = Cox, continuous score; median = median split; opt_naive / opt_corrected = optimal cut-point, naive /
corrected p; cox_adj_* = Cox adjusted for proliferation (and stage). NA: not applicable.

